    },
    "%@, %@ and %@ can start a long command, such as a build or a test run, in the background and keep working, so the answer may come before the command finishes.\n\n%@ and %@ then keep the turn open until the command ends and they have reported on it. The timer keeps counting and Stop stays; a message you send meanwhile waits above the message box until the turn ends. A line under the answer names what the agent is waiting for, and a short notice says when the background task finished or was stopped. With %@ version 2.1.310 or newer, each task on that line has a Stop of its own, which stops that task alone. Stop under the message box ends the turn and stops the background task with it; so does quitting SipAI. %@ stops a background task that runs past its time limit, and reports that it did. With a %@ older than version 2.1.309, SipAI has %@ run every command in the foreground instead, because an older version stops a background task a few seconds after its answer.\n\n%@ calls such a command a background terminal. The turn stays open until the command ends, with the same line naming it, and a Stop beside each command stops that command alone; %@ doesn't report on it afterwards, so its result shows in the command's own row. Stop under the message box ends the turn and stops the command with it." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: what happens to a background task an agent starts; placeholders, in order: the Claude Code, Codex and Kimi Code labels; the Claude Code and Kimi Code labels; the Claude Code label four times; the Codex label twice",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@、%2$@ 和 %3$@ 可以把耗时较长的命令（例如构建或测试）放到后台运行，同时继续工作，所以回答可能在命令结束之前就出现。\n\n这时 %4$@ 和 %5$@ 会让这一回合保持进行中，直到命令结束、它们汇报了结果为止：计时器继续计时，“停止”按钮保留；这期间你发送的消息会停在输入框上方，等这一回合结束。回答下方会有一行说明智能体在等待什么；后台任务完成或被停止时，会出现一条简短的提示。使用 2.1.310 或更新版本的 %6$@ 时，那一行里的每个任务都有自己的“停止”，只停止这一个任务。点输入框下方的“停止”会结束这一回合，并一同停止后台任务；退出 SipAI 也是如此。后台任务超出时间限制时，%7$@ 会停止它，并汇报这一情况。如果 %8$@ 的版本低于 2.1.309，SipAI 会让 %9$@ 把所有命令放在前台运行，因为旧版本会在回答后几秒内就停止后台任务。\n\n%10$@ 把这样的命令称为后台终端。这一回合会保持进行中，直到命令结束，同样会有一行写明这条命令，每条命令旁的“停止”只停止这一条命令；之后 %11$@ 不会再汇报，所以命令的结果显示在它自己的那一行里。点输入框下方的“停止”会结束这一回合，并一同停止这条命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
