    },
    "An image can only be attached to a NEW %@ chat, not to one already under way." : {
      "comment" : "Runner error: images are refused on a resumed kimi session; placeholder is the agent label",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只能在新的 %@ 对话中附加图片，无法附加到已在进行的对话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An MCP server you've added to an agent can pause one of its tools to ask you something: to fill in a short form, to answer yes or no, or to open a link in your browser — to sign in, say. %@, and %@ in Default and Plan, show it on a card that names the server, and the timer stops while it waits. Submit sends your answers straight to the server: a required field must be filled in, and a field that takes a number or a date says so. Decline sends nothing, and the tool carries on without it. For a link, open it, finish there, then choose “I’m done, continue”. With Non-stop on, no card is shown and the server is declined.\n\nA card can show up to 8 fields, and up to 12 choices in each. A field can be text, a number, yes or no, or one or several choices. SipAI can't show a form that goes beyond this, so it declines it for you, as if you'd chosen Decline, and no card appears.\n\nIn Default and Plan, %@ also asks on a card before it runs an MCP tool that might change something. “Allow for this session” lasts until the turn ends, because SipAI starts it afresh for each message. “Always allow” is saved in its own settings, so that tool won't ask again — in SipAI or in %@'s own apps. In Read Only, Workspace Write and Full Access, it can't ask you anything: it declines a server's forms and links itself. In Read Only and Workspace Write it also declines a yes-or-no and won't run an MCP tool that needs approval; in Full Access it accepts a yes-or-no and runs the tool without asking.\n\n%@ doesn't accept forms from MCP servers, so its servers can't ask; when it asks before running an MCP tool, it uses the same card as for its other tools." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: what each agent does when an MCP server asks for input; placeholders, in order: the Claude Code label, the Codex label three times, the Kimi Code label",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你为智能体添加的 MCP 服务器可以暂停它的某个工具来向你询问：填写一个简短的表单、回答是或否，或者在浏览器中打开一个链接（例如为了登录）。%1$@，以及处于“默认”和“规划”模式的 %2$@，会把它显示在一张注明服务器名称的卡片上，等待期间计时器会暂停。“提交”会把你的回答直接发送给服务器：必填字段必须填写，需要数字或日期的字段会注明。“拒绝”则什么也不发送，工具会在没有回答的情况下继续。遇到链接时，先打开它，在那里完成操作，再选择“我已完成，继续”。开启“不间断”时不会显示卡片，并会拒绝服务器的请求。\n\n一张卡片最多显示 8 个字段，每个字段最多 12 个选项。字段可以是文字、数字、是或否、单选或多选。超出这个范围的表单，SipAI 无法显示，会替你拒绝它，就像你选择了“拒绝”一样，不会出现卡片。\n\n在“默认”和“规划”模式下，%3$@ 在运行可能做出改动的 MCP 工具之前也会用卡片询问。“在本次会话中允许”只在这一回合结束前有效，因为 SipAI 每发一条消息都会重新启动它。“始终允许”会保存在它自己的设置中，此后这个工具不会再询问——无论在 SipAI 中还是在 %4$@ 自己的应用中。在“只读”“工作区写入”和“完全访问”模式下，它无法向你询问任何事：它会自行拒绝服务器的表单和链接。在“只读”和“工作区写入”模式下，它还会拒绝是或否的询问，并且不会运行需要批准的 MCP 工具；在“完全访问”模式下，它会接受是或否的询问，并且不经询问就运行该工具。\n\n%5$@ 不接受 MCP 服务器的表单，因此它的服务器无法询问；当它在运行 MCP 工具前询问时，使用的是和其他工具相同的卡片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An update is available" : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip and accessibility label on the download badge beside Settings and beside its Updates row",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有可用的更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An update is ready and will be installed once the running agent turn finishes." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane: the install is waiting for agent turns to end",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新已就绪，将在正在进行的智能体回合结束后安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An update you can install stays beside the logo, with an Update button, until you use it or close it. A session waiting for you shows there for 10 seconds; a finished chat or agent response, and an update that has landed, for 5." : {
      "comment" : "Settings: help text under the switch for the notifications beside the sidebar's logo",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以安装的更新会一直显示在标志旁，并带有“更新”按钮，直到你使用或关闭它。等待你处理的会话会在那里显示 10 秒；对话或智能体完成回复、以及已完成的更新，显示 5 秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another skill with this name reaches the same agent, which uses only one of them. Rename or delete one." : {
      "comment" : "Skills detail: a name clash",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
