            "value" : "Anthropic Console——按 API 用量计费。将在浏览器中打开 platform.claude.com。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apart from your AI providers, SipAI goes online only for updates. It checks once a day for a new version of SipAI, and a few times a day for new versions of your agent tools. It downloads SipAI or a tool only when you choose to install or update it. You can turn off both checks in Settings → Updates." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Privacy, third paragraph: the update checks are the only other connections",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除了你的 AI 提供商，SipAI 只会为了更新而联网。它每天检查一次 SipAI 是否有新版本，并每天检查几次你的智能体工具是否有新版本。只有在你选择安装或更新时，它才会下载 SipAI 或某个工具。你可以在“设置 → 更新”中关闭这两项检查。"
          }
