    "Applies to the sidebar, the conversation, the text box and its controls, notes, and Settings. Bigger sizes also widen line spacing; Large text mode doubles it. Change it from anywhere with View → Zoom In (⌘+), Zoom Out (⌘−) and Actual Size (⌘0)." : {
