    "Background task finished: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Transcript notice: a background task the agent started has finished; placeholder is the task's description",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后台任务已完成：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background task stopped: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Transcript notice: a background task the agent started was stopped before it finished; placeholder is the task's description",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后台任务已停止：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before %@ sends your message, it checks the size of the whole conversation. When a file it reads as a session starts, such as the project's CLAUDE.md, has changed since your last message, it attaches the whole file again. Near the end of a long conversation, that can make the conversation too large for the model, and %@ answers “Prompt is too long” instead of compacting the conversation first. SipAI then sends your message once more. This time %@ compacts the conversation (the “Conversation compacted” row) and answers. That is why your message appears twice, with the notice between. If it is refused again, the turn ends there. SipAI starts %@ afresh for each message, so this can follow any change to such a file; in %@'s own terminal it can happen when you resume a session." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: why Claude Code refuses a message as too long and how SipAI sends it again; every placeholder is the Claude Code label",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 在发送你的消息之前，会先检查整个对话的大小。如果它在会话开始时读取的文件（比如项目的 CLAUDE.md）在你上一条消息之后改动过，它会把整个文件重新附上。在很长的对话接近尾声时，这可能让对话超出模型的上限，%@ 就会回复“Prompt is too long”，而不会先压缩对话。这时 SipAI 会把你的消息再发送一次。这一次 %@ 会先压缩对话（即“对话已压缩”那一行），然后回答。所以你的消息会出现两次，中间是那条提示。如果再次被拒，这一回合就到此结束。SipAI 为每条消息重新启动 %@，所以这类文件的任何改动之后都可能出现这种情况；在 %@ 自己的终端里，恢复会话时也可能遇到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Being asked once per folder is normal. Agent sessions read and edit files in your working folder, so the first time SipAI opens a project inside Desktop, Documents, Downloads, iCloud Drive, or an external drive, macOS asks permission. Click Allow and the answer is remembered — including after you restart. You can review or change it any time in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Files and Folders. Scheduled tasks run inside SipAI, so they reuse the same permission instead of asking again." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: folder access permission prompts",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个文件夹被询问一次是正常的。智能体会话会读取和修改你工作文件夹中的文件，因此当 SipAI 第一次打开位于「桌面」「文稿」「下载」「iCloud 云盘」或外置磁盘中的项目时，macOS 会请求授权。点击「允许」后这个回答会被记住——包括重启之后。你可以随时在「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 文件和文件夹」中查看或更改。计划任务在 SipAI 内部运行，因此会复用同一份授权，不会再次询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
