    "Compact view" : {
      "comment" : "Switch in the toolbar's agent session window and in Settings → Display → Agent sessions: draw each of the agent's answers as one line, its final message under it",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "简洁版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compact view — the switch in the toolbar's agent session window, also in Settings → Display and View → Agent Session Compact View (⌃⌘O) — draws each of the agent's answers as one line, with its final message under it. The line holds everything between your message and that final message: the agent's thinking, its tool calls, the messages it wrote along the way, its questions with your answers, a plan you reviewed, notices such as a compacted conversation, and a background task reporting back with the agent's reply to it. While the agent works, the line shows the newest of these; afterwards, what it did, such as “Edited 2 files · Ran 3 commands · 2 messages”, with an orange mark if a step failed. Click the line to see everything in it, and a step to see its details. A question, a plan or an approval still shows its card while it waits for you, and joins the line once you answer. Your own messages stay as they are, including one you send while the agent works; the error or stop that ends an answer shows with its final message; and the agent's name shows once, at the top of each answer. A Chat only turn looks like this with Compact view on or off. Only the drawing changes: what the agent does, and what is sent to it, stay the same.\n\nHow much of the agent's thinking a line shows depends on what each tool saves under its own settings. %@ saves short progress notes by default, and fuller summaries when its showThinkingSummaries setting is on — SipAI then asks for them, as %@'s own terminal does. %@ saves summaries of its thinking only when its config sets model_reasoning_summary. %@ saves its model's thinking whenever the model thinks. A Chat only turn asks %@ and %@ for their thinking whatever their settings say." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: what Compact view does and how much thinking each agent saves; placeholders, in order: the Claude Code label twice, the Codex label, the Kimi Code label, the Claude Code and Codex labels",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "简洁版（工具栏中智能体会话窗口里的开关，也在「设置 → 显示」和“显示”菜单的“智能体会话简洁版”（⌃⌘O）中）把智能体的每次回复显示为一行，并把这次回复的最后一条消息显示在这一行下方。这一行包含从你的消息到那条最后消息之间的一切：智能体的思考、工具调用、途中写下的消息、它的提问和你的回答、你审阅过的计划、“对话已压缩”之类的通知，以及后台任务的回报和智能体对它的回复。智能体工作时，这一行显示其中最新的一项；完成后，显示它做了什么，例如“已编辑 2 个文件 · 已运行 3 条命令 · 2 条消息”；若有步骤失败，还会带一个橙色标记。点击这一行可查看其中的全部内容，再点击某个步骤可查看其详情。提问、计划或审批在等待你时仍会显示它的卡片，你作答后便收进这一行。你自己的消息保持原样，包括智能体工作时你发送的消息；结束一次回复的错误或中断与最后一条消息一起显示；智能体的名称在每次回复的顶部只显示一次。“仅对话”回合无论是否开启简洁版，都这样显示。改变的只是显示方式：智能体做什么、发送给它的内容，都保持不变。\n\n一行能显示多少智能体的思考，取决于每个工具在其自身设置下保存了什么。%@ 默认保存简短的进度说明，开启其 showThinkingSummaries 设置后会保存更完整的摘要——此时 SipAI 会请求这些摘要，与 %@ 自己的终端一样。%@ 只有在其配置设置了 model_reasoning_summary 时才保存思考摘要。%@ 只要模型在思考，就会保存模型的思考。“仅对话”回合则无论设置如何，都会向 %@ 和 %@ 请求思考内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
