        }
      }
    },
    "Each agent uses the skills in its own skills folder. Share With, in a skill’s … menu, gives it to another agent: SipAI keeps one copy in its library and links it into each agent that has it, so one edit changes it for all of them." : {
      "comment" : "Skills pane: what the pane shows and how sharing works",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个智能体使用其自身技能文件夹中的技能。技能“…”菜单中的“共享给”可将它交给另一个智能体：SipAI 在技能库中保留一份副本，并链接到每个拥有它的智能体，因此编辑一次，所有智能体都会随之更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each one loads once, with your next message, and again only if the agent drops it while summarising the conversation." : {
      "comment" : "Skill chip summary: how preloading works",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个技能随你的下一条消息加载一次；只有当智能体在压缩对话时丢弃了它，才会再次加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each provider has their dashboard to help users track their API credit usage. Please check your account dashboard for more information. SipAI also shows how full each agent session's context window is, in the chip under the composer. Plan limits (the 5-hour and weekly windows of a subscription) are a different thing — see the next question." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: tracking usage",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每家提供商都提供控制台，帮助用户追踪 API 额度用量。更多信息请查看你的账号控制台。SipAI 也会在每个智能体会话的输入框下方显示上下文窗口的使用比例。套餐额度（订阅的 5 小时窗口和每周窗口）是另一回事——见下一个问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each provider issues keys from its own dashboard. For examples, OpenAI at platform.openai.com/api-keys, Anthropic at console.anthropic.com, Google (Gemini) at aistudio.google.com, DeepSeek at platform.deepseek.com, Alibaba Qwen in the DashScope console, xAI at console.x.ai. You may need to register for their accounts and create a key there, then in SipAI click Add Model (in the chat composer or Settings → Chat Settings), pick the provider, and paste the key when asked. Some providers issue region-bound keys (e.g. Qwen, Kimi): pick the region that matches where the key was created." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: getting an API key",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每家提供商都在自己的控制台签发密钥。例如，OpenAI 在 platform.openai.com/api-keys，Anthropic 在 console.anthropic.com，Google（Gemini）在 aistudio.google.com，DeepSeek 在 platform.deepseek.com，阿里通义千问在 DashScope 控制台，xAI 在 console.x.ai。你可能需要先注册他们的账号并在那里创建密钥，然后在 SipAI 中点击「添加模型」（在对话输入框或「设置 → 对话设置」中），选择提供商，并在提示时粘贴密钥。有些提供商签发的密钥与地区绑定（例如通义千问、Kimi）：请选择与密钥创建地相符的地区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each role is a reusable system prompt you can switch to in chat." : {
      "comment" : "Roles help text",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个角色都是一段可复用的系统提示词，你可以在对话中随时切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "each run loads %@" : {
      "comment" : "Armed-schedule banner: the skills the new task's runs load; placeholder lists them",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次运行加载 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each run loads them with its prompt. A run whose skill is missing or switched off doesn’t start." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-task editor: how a task's skills work",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次运行都会随任务描述加载这些技能。若某个技能缺失或已关闭，该次运行不会开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earlier turns aren't loaded — this session's transcript is %@ and the newest %@ are shown." : {
      "comment" : "Static note atop a transcript too big to load whole; placeholders are the file size and the loaded size",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更早的对话未加载——本会话的记录共 %@，当前显示最新的 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
