          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its folder is outside SipAI’s library, so it stays where it is." : {
      "comment" : "Skills: delete confirmation for a linked folder SipAI does not manage",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其文件夹不在 SipAI 的技能库中，因此会保留在原处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "its folder’s name holds a hidden or direction-changing character, a space at either end or two in a row, a blank other than a space, a stray accent mark, or < or >" : {
      "comment" : "Skills: why Claude Code skips a skill, the end of a sentence — its folder's name has a character Claude does not offer a skill under",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其文件夹名称含有隐藏字符、改变文字方向的字符、首尾或连续的空格、普通空格以外的空白字符、孤立的重音符号，或 < 或 >"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its link is broken." : {
      "comment" : "Skill chip: a skill whose link points at nothing",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其链接已失效。"
