    "Set Default" : {
      "comment" : "Model row menu: make this the default model\nSet this model as the default",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设为默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings" : {
      "comment" : "Sidebar: open settings",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share With" : {
      "comment" : "Skills: submenu that gives a skill to another agent",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "共享给"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share With, in a skill's … menu in Settings → Agent Skills, gives it to another agent in one click. SipAI keeps one copy of the skill in its own library (~/.sipai/skills, or .sipai/skills in a project) and links it into each agent's skills folder. A skill that sat in one agent's own folder moves into the library first, with a link left where it was, so the agents that had it see no change. Because there is one copy, an edit — in SipAI or in any editor — changes the skill for every agent that has it.\n\nEach agent reads SKILL.md its own way. When the agent you share with couldn't load the file as written, SipAI fixes it in place first: it adds a missing name or description, puts quotes around a value that agent can't read, or writes a list as one sentence. What it can't fix stops the share, with a message saying why. \"Only when I call it\" carries over in the new agent's own words: %@ keeps it in its agents/openai.yaml file, while %@ and %@ both read the disable-model-invocation line in SKILL.md — so setting it for one of those two sets it for the other. Where SipAI can't write it for the new agent, the skill is still shared and the page says that agent may use it on its own. Settings that only one agent understands, such as %@'s agents/openai.yaml or %@'s allowed-tools, are ignored by the others, so a skill that depends on one may work differently there." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: what sharing a skill does; placeholders are the Codex, Claude Code and Kimi Code labels",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“设置 → 智能体技能”中，技能“…”菜单里的“共享给”可一键把技能交给另一个智能体。SipAI 在自己的技能库（~/.sipai/skills，项目中则为 .sipai/skills）里保留一份技能副本，并把它链接到每个智能体的技能文件夹。原本位于某个智能体自身文件夹中的技能会先移入技能库，并在原处留下链接，因此原来拥有它的智能体不会察觉任何变化。由于只有一份副本，无论在 SipAI 中还是在任何编辑器里修改，所有拥有它的智能体都会随之更新。\n\n每个智能体读取 SKILL.md 的方式各不相同。如果目标智能体无法按原样加载该文件，SipAI 会先就地修正：补上缺失的名称或描述，给该智能体读不懂的值加上引号，或把列表写成一句话。无法修正的问题会中止共享，并给出原因。“仅在我调用时”会以目标智能体自己的方式带过去：%@ 把它记在自己的 agents/openai.yaml 文件中，而 %@ 和 %@ 都读取 SKILL.md 中的 disable-model-invocation 这一行——因此为其中一个设置后，另一个也会随之生效。如果 SipAI 无法为目标智能体写入这一设置，技能仍会共享，页面会提示该智能体可能自行使用它。只有某个智能体才懂的设置（例如 %@ 的 agents/openai.yaml 或 %@ 的 allowed-tools）会被其他智能体忽略，因此依赖这类设置的技能在那里的表现可能有所不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "shared with %@" : {
      "comment" : "Skills: hint beside a skill other agents have too; placeholder lists the agents",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已与 %@ 共享"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "shared with %@ in the common folder" : {
      "comment" : "Skills: hint beside a skill in .agents/skills that other agents have too; placeholder lists the agents",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已在通用文件夹中与 %@ 共享"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show %@ in SipAI. Unticked, it stays installed and signed in on this Mac, but its sessions leave the sidebar and search, its scheduled tasks stop running, and nothing about it is shown or checked until you tick it again." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: hover on the show/hide checkbox; placeholder is the agent's name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 SipAI 中显示 %@。取消勾选后，它在这台 Mac 上仍保持安装和登录，但会话会从侧边栏和搜索中消失，计划任务停止运行，且不再显示或检查与它相关的任何内容，直到重新勾选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show all (%lld more)" : {
      "comment" : "Sidebar: reveal the rows the cap hid",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
