    },
    "Shows each answer’s thinking, tool calls and messages as one line, with its final message under it. Click a line to see its steps." : {
      "comment" : "Line under the Compact view switch (toolbar window and Settings → Display)",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将每次回复的思考、工具调用和消息显示为一行，并把这次回复的最后一条消息显示在这一行下方。点击某行即可查看其中的步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows each answer’s thinking, tool calls and messages as one line, with its final message under it. Click a line to see its steps. The same switch is in the toolbar, and in View → Agent Session Compact View (⌃⌘O)." : {
      "comment" : "Settings: help text under the Compact view switch; names the toolbar button and the View menu item with its shortcut",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将每次回复的思考、工具调用和消息显示为一行，并把这次回复的最后一条消息显示在这一行下方。点击某行即可查看其中的步骤。工具栏中，以及“显示”菜单的“智能体会话简洁版”（⌃⌘O）中，也有同一个开关。"
