      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在退出登录…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI %@ will install once the running turn finishes." : {
      "comment" : "Sidebar notice beside the logo, the whole sentence (its hover and VoiceOver) of SipAI's update held for a running agent turn — the user chose to wait; placeholder is the new version",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI %@ 将在正在进行的智能体回合结束后安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI asks each tool's own release endpoint — the npm registry, or the vendor's version file — every few hours whether a newer version exists. A tool is updated only by running its own update command, or, where that command declines and names the vendor's installer instead, by running that installer pinned to the version shown." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane: what the CLI version check does",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 会每隔几小时向每个工具自己的发布接口（npm 仓库，或厂商的版本文件）查询是否有更新的版本。更新工具时只会运行该工具自带的更新命令；若该命令拒绝更新并指向厂商的安装脚本，则运行该安装脚本，并固定为所显示的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI asks updates.sipai.dev once a day whether a newer version exists. Nothing is downloaded until you choose to install it." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane: what the automatic check does",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 每天向 updates.sipai.dev 查询一次是否有新版本。在你选择安装之前不会下载任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI can’t write in %@." : {
      "comment" : "Skills: a share, delete or new skill refused because a folder it must write in is read-only; placeholder is a path",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 无法写入 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI collects no data. There is no SipAI account, no SipAI server, and no analytics or tracking. Your chats, notes and settings are stored only on your Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Privacy, first paragraph: SipAI collects nothing and keeps its data on this Mac",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 不收集任何数据。没有 SipAI 账号，没有 SipAI 服务器，也没有任何分析或追踪。你的对话、笔记和设置只保存在你的 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI could not write this note's file. Your changes are still here — they will be saved again on the next edit." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip explaining the note save failure badge",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 无法写入这条笔记的文件。你的修改仍然保留——下次编辑时会再次尝试保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI couldn’t check whether the installed %@ can run %@ mode, so the run didn’t start." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-run failure: what decides whether the agent CLI can run the task's mode could not be read in time; placeholders are the agent label and the mode's name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 无法确认已安装的 %1$@ 能否运行“%2$@”模式，因此本次运行未启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI couldn’t read the installed %@’s version, so it can’t tell how Default runs here. Send again, or pick another mode." : {
      "comment" : "Runner error: a Default-mode turn on codex or kimi was not started because the installed CLI's version could not be read in time; placeholder is the agent label",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 无法读取已安装的 %@ 的版本，因此无法确定“默认”在这里如何运行。请重新发送，或选择其他模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI didn’t look in every subfolder here, so one with skills may be missing. Choose Folder… in the folder menu shows a subfolder’s own skills." : {
      "comment" : "Skills: the page stopped looking below the chosen folder before it had been through every subfolder",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 没有查看这里的每一个子文件夹，因此可能漏掉了含技能的子文件夹。文件夹菜单中的“选择文件夹…”可显示某个子文件夹自己的技能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI doesn’t change this skill’s files." : {
      "comment" : "Skills: a write refused for a skill the agent manages itself",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 不会更改此技能的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI doesn't run cloud sessions of its own. Each tool's cloud commands work here as they do in that tool's own terminal: type the command after ! in an agent session's message box. A line that starts with ! is your own shell command. SipAI hands it to the tool to run its own way — no model, no approval, no sandbox — and the output joins the conversation. For example, !claude -p \"…\" --cloud <session id> sends a message to a %@ cloud session, !codex cloud list lists your %@ cloud tasks, and !codex cloud exec --env <environment> \"…\" starts one. After a ! command, %@ answers its output unless respondToBashCommands is off in its settings; %@ reads it with your next message. While a turn runs, a ! command waits above the message box until the turn ends. ! commands need %@ 2.1.310 or newer and %@ 0.165.0 or newer.\n\nSome things differ from the tools' own terminals. A new %@ cloud session (claude --cloud \"…\") needs a terminal window, which ! doesn't give it — nor does %@'s own !. Start one in Terminal, in the Claude app or at claude.ai/code. %@'s screen commands, such as /teleport and /ultraplan, answer \"isn't available in this environment\" here, and /ultrareview and /code-review ultra skip the confirmation %@'s terminal shows before a review starts. A ! command in a %@ session runs as in %@'s terminal — in your own shell, with your aliases and functions, with no input, and in the folder the last one ended in while that stays inside the session's folder — except that the folder doesn't carry over to %@'s own commands, and a long command runs until it ends or you press Stop, where %@'s terminal stops it, or moves it to the background, once its Bash timeout (2 minutes by default) runs out. %@ runs a ! command here exactly as in its terminal.\n\nA cloud session you bring back with claude --teleport becomes an ordinary session on this Mac, and appears in the sidebar. %@ Cloud needs a ChatGPT plan and a %@ Cloud environment. %@ has no cloud sessions, and offers apps no way to run a ! command, so in a %@ session a line that starts with ! is sent as an ordinary message. The message box says what Send will do before you send." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: cloud sessions and ! commands, and what differs from the tools' own terminals; placeholders, in order: the Claude Code label, the Codex label, the Claude Code label, the Codex label, the Claude Code label, the Codex label, the Claude Code label eight times, the Codex label three times, the Kimi Code label twice",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 自己不运行云端会话。每个工具的云端命令在这里的用法，和在该工具自己的终端里一样：在智能体会话的输入框中，于 ! 之后输入命令。以 ! 开头的一行是你自己的 shell 命令。SipAI 把它交给该工具按自己的方式运行——不经过模型、无需批准、不受沙盒限制——输出会加入对话。例如，!claude -p \"…\" --cloud <会话 ID> 会向 %1$@ 的云端会话发送一条消息，!codex cloud list 会列出你的 %2$@ 云端任务，!codex cloud exec --env <环境> \"…\" 会新建一个。执行 ! 命令后，%3$@ 会回应它的输出，除非你在它的设置中关闭了 respondToBashCommands；%4$@ 会在你发下一条消息时读到它。回合进行中时，! 命令会停在输入框上方，等这一回合结束。! 命令需要 %5$@ 2.1.310 或更高版本，以及 %6$@ 0.165.0 或更高版本。\n\n有几处与这些工具自己的终端不同。新建 %7$@ 云端会话（claude --cloud \"…\"）需要一个终端窗口，而 ! 不提供终端窗口——%8$@ 自己的 ! 也不提供。请在“终端”、Claude 应用或 claude.ai/code 中新建。%9$@ 依赖界面的命令（例如 /teleport 和 /ultraplan）在这里会回答“isn't available in this environment”；/ultrareview 和 /code-review ultra 会跳过 %10$@ 的终端在审查开始前显示的确认。%11$@ 会话中的 ! 命令，运行方式与在 %12$@ 的终端里一样——在你自己的 shell 中运行，你的别名和函数都可用，不给它任何输入，并且只要上一条命令结束时所在的文件夹仍在会话文件夹之内，就从那里开始——不同之处在于：这个文件夹不会延续到 %13$@ 自己的命令；耗时较长的命令会一直运行，直到结束或你按下“停止”，而 %14$@ 的终端会在它的 Bash 超时（默认 2 分钟）到时停止该命令，或将其移到后台。%15$@ 的 ! 命令在这里的运行方式与在它的终端里完全相同。\n\n用 claude --teleport 取回到这台 Mac 上的云端会话会变成普通会话，并显示在侧边栏中。%16$@ Cloud 需要 ChatGPT 套餐和一个 %17$@ Cloud 环境。%18$@ 没有云端会话，也没有提供让应用运行 ! 命令的方式，所以在 %19$@ 会话中，以 ! 开头的一行会作为普通消息发送。发送之前，输入框上方会说明“发送”将做什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI doesn’t support this for this agent yet." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal for an agent SipAI has no code for",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 暂不支持对此智能体进行这项操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI downloads Anthropic's installer from claude.ai and runs it. It installs to ~/.local/bin and may add that folder to your shell's PATH so Terminal finds it too. About 200 MB." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: install confirmation body for Claude Code",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 将从 claude.ai 下载 Anthropic 的安装程序并运行。它会安装到 ~/.local/bin，并可能把该目录加入 shell 的 PATH，以便“终端”也能找到它。约 200 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI downloads Moonshot's installer from code.kimi.com and runs it. It installs to ~/.kimi-code/bin and adds that folder to your shell's PATH." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: install confirmation body for Kimi Code",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 将从 code.kimi.com 下载 Moonshot 的安装程序并运行。它会安装到 ~/.kimi-code/bin，并把该目录加入 shell 的 PATH。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI downloads OpenAI's release package (about 120 MB) from github.com/openai/codex, checks it against OpenAI's checksum file, and installs it under ~/.local/share/sipai/codex with a codex command in ~/.local/bin — adding that folder to your shell's PATH if Terminal does not see it yet. SipAI keeps this copy up to date from the same place; if you would rather have Homebrew or npm manage it, install it there yourself and SipAI will use that copy instead." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: install confirmation body for Codex",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 将从 github.com/openai/codex 下载 OpenAI 的发布包（约 120 MB），用 OpenAI 的校验文件核对后安装到 ~/.local/share/sipai/codex，并在 ~/.local/bin 放置 codex 命令——如果“终端”还找不到它，会把该目录加入 shell 的 PATH。SipAI 会从同一来源保持这份副本为最新；如果你更愿意用 Homebrew 或 npm 管理，请自行在那里安装，SipAI 会改用那份副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI runs each supported provider's own command-line tool on this Mac and shows its sessions in the sidebar. You must have access to a provider before you can use its tool in SipAI — some AI providers aren't available in every country or region." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide intro, first paragraph: what SipAI runs, and that access to the provider comes first",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 在这台 Mac 上运行每家受支持提供商自己的命令行工具，并把它的会话显示在侧边栏。你必须先拥有某家提供商的使用权限，才能在 SipAI 中使用它的工具——部分 AI 提供商并非在所有国家或地区都提供服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI starts %@ afresh for each message, so a “this session” or “these files” answer lasts until this message’s turn ends." : {
      "comment" : "Note under a codex approval card that offers an answer for the session; placeholder is the agent label",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 每发一条消息都会重新启动 %@，因此“此会话”或“这些文件”的答复只在这条消息的这一轮内有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI will install the update and relaunch once the work finishes. Interrupting stops that work now, the same as quitting, and installs right away. If you quit SipAI before then, the update is installed on the way out and SipAI stays closed." : {
      "comment" : "Update-hold sheet body: the choice between waiting for the running turn and interrupting it",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 会在这些工作结束后安装更新并重新启动。“中断”会立即停止这些工作（与退出相同）并马上安装。若在此之前退出 SipAI，更新会在退出过程中安装，SipAI 不会重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI won’t open this link: it opens only https links it can show exactly as they would open." : {
      "comment" : "Note on the card for a link an MCP server asks to have opened, when SipAI will not open it",
      "localizations" : {
