    "Small" : {
      "comment" : "User-selectable font size tier name.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So that %@ can load it, SipAI changes the skill’s own files:" : {
      "comment" : "Skills: introduces the list of fixes that make a skill load for an agent; placeholder is the agent",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为使 %@ 能够加载它，SipAI 会修改此技能自身的文件："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some of %@'s models ask questions without stopping: %@ keeps working while the question waits, and if no answer comes it decides by itself — it carries on with an assumption it tells you about, or ends its turn with the question still open. The question appears on a card. Answer while %@ is still working and it reads your answer in the same turn; the timer keeps running, because %@ hasn't stopped. When the turn ends, the card goes away, as it does in %@'s own app; whatever you had started to answer moves into the message box under its question, ready to send as your next message. In Chat only, SipAI runs %@ as a one-shot command that can't receive anything until it finishes, so the question appears as %@'s own message, its options as a list, and you answer in your next message. %@'s questions, and the questions %@ asks in Plan that pause the turn, are different: they wait until you answer. With Non-stop on, no card is shown." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: how Codex's questions asked without stopping reach the user in each mode; placeholders are the Codex and Claude Code labels",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 的部分模型会在不停下的情况下提问：%@ 在问题等待回答时继续工作；如果没有等到回答，它会自行决定——要么按它说明的假设继续，要么在问题仍未解决时结束这一回合。问题会出现在卡片上。在 %@ 仍在工作时作答，它会在同一回合里读到你的回答；计时器不会停，因为 %@ 并没有停下。回合结束后卡片会消失，%@ 自己的应用也是这样；你已开始填写的回答会连同它的问题移到输入框里，可作为下一条消息发送。在“仅对话”模式下，SipAI 以一次性命令运行 %@，命令结束前无法接收任何内容，所以问题会作为 %@ 自己的消息出现，选项列成清单，你在下一条消息里回答。%@ 的问题，以及 %@ 在“规划”模式下提出的会暂停回合的问题，则不同：它们会一直等你回答。开启“不间断”时不会显示卡片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something is already at %@." : {
