        }
      }
    },
    "the %@ in its SKILL.md is not text" : {
      "comment" : "Skills: why an agent skips a skill; ends a sentence; placeholder is a header key, name or description",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其 SKILL.md 中的 %@ 不是文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent never uses it on its own; you start it by name." : {
      "comment" : "Skills: what only-when-called means",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体不会自行使用它；需由你按名称启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent reads this to decide when the skill applies." : {
      "comment" : "Skills: why the description matters",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体会据此判断何时使用此技能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer was in a shape SipAI does not read." : {
      "comment" : "Plan-usage card: the agent's usage answer did not parse",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回应的格式 SipAI 无法读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser sign-in was not completed in time." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: no login completion arrived inside the ceiling",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "浏览器登录没有在规定时间内完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The change applies to the next turn of every %@ session, here and in your terminal, and shows in the chip at once. A larger request draws on your plan's limits or API usage faster." : {
      "comment" : "Help card, closing paragraph; placeholder is the Codex label",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更改从每个 %@ 会话的下一轮开始生效，在这里和你的终端里都一样，并会立即反映在输入框下方的显示上。更大的请求会更快消耗你的套餐额度或 API 用量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Chat section talks to AI models through their API endpoints and is billed per token. To add a model, click the model chip at the lower right of the chat box, or open Settings → Chat Settings. If you would rather use a subscription plan than an API key, the **Chat only** mode of an agent session gives you a similar kind of conversation — it is limited to the agent providers SipAI supports. [Learn more](sipai://settings/chat)" : {
      "comment" : "Empty chat page while no chat model is configured. Keep the [Learn more](sipai://settings/chat) link and the **Chat only** mode name (the mode chip's row).",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“对话”部分通过各家的 API 接口使用 AI 模型，按 token 计费。要添加模型，请点击输入框右下角的模型标签，或打开“设置 → 对话设置”。如果你更想用订阅套餐而不是 API 密钥，智能体会话的“**仅对话**”模式能提供类似的聊天体验——它仅限于 SipAI 支持的智能体提供商。[了解更多](sipai://settings/chat)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The codex command could not be placed at %@: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: the symlink for codex could not be written; placeholders are the path and the error",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法在 %1$@ 放置 codex 命令：%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command failed" : {
      "comment" : "Transcript line under a ! command that failed without an exit code",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "命令失败"
          }
        }
