          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The group goes away, and every session in it is removed for every app that reads it — SipAI, the CLI, and the desktop app. Its scheduled tasks and their runs are kept and move to Ungrouped. This cannot be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the confirmation for a custom session group's Delete the group, when it also holds scheduled tasks",
