        }
      }
    },
    "The note could not be measured for printing." : {
      "comment" : "PDF export failure reason",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法计算笔记的打印版面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note took too long to lay out." : {
      "comment" : "PDF export failure reason",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "笔记排版耗时过长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Notes, Chats and Chat groups headers each have a … menu. Hide takes that section off the sidebar; nothing in it is deleted. To show it again, turn it back on in Settings → Display, under Show sections. Agent sections are shown and hidden in Settings → Agent Initialization.\n\nWhen an agent's sessions are grouped by Folder or Custom, each group's header has a … menu between its count and its +, and everything you can do to the group is in that menu. Mark all as read clears the steady blue dot of every session in the group. Grouped by Folder, Delete all sessions deletes every session in that folder, for every app that reads them, not only SipAI; the folder and your files are not touched. Grouped by Custom, the section's first row is New group, and a session starts from its group's +. A group's … menu renames it; Delete the group deletes the group and every session in it, and Ungroup deletes only the group: its sessions move to Ungrouped. Ungrouped is always shown there, with a + that starts a session in no group and a … menu with Delete all sessions.\n\nScheduled tasks and their runs are never deleted from these menus; a task's own … menu has its own deletes, and Mark all as read for its runs. Every delete asks first and says what goes." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: the … menus on the sidebar's section headers (Hide) and on an agent's Folder and Custom group headers (Mark all as read, the deletes, Ungroup)",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「笔记」「对话」和「对话分组」的标题上各有一个“…”菜单。“隐藏”会把该分区从侧边栏移走，其中的内容不会被删除。如需再次显示，请在「设置 → 显示」的“显示分区”下重新打开它。智能体分区在「设置 → 智能体初始化」中显示或隐藏。\n\n当智能体的会话按文件夹或自定义分组时，每个分组标题上的数量和 + 之间都有一个“…”菜单，对该分组的所有操作都在这个菜单里。“全部标为已读”会清除该分组中每个会话的蓝色圆点。按文件夹分组时，“删除所有会话”会删除该文件夹中的每个会话，对所有读取它们的 App 一并移除，而不只是 SipAI；文件夹和你的文件不会受到影响。按自定义分组时，分区的第一行是“新建分组”，会话从各分组的 + 开始。分组的“…”菜单可以重命名分组；“删除分组”会删除该分组及其中的每个会话，“取消分组”只删除分组本身，其中的会话会移到「未分组」。「未分组」在这种方式下始终显示，它的 + 用来新建不属于任何分组的会话，它的“…”菜单里有“删除所有会话”。\n\n这些菜单永远不会删除计划任务及其运行记录；计划任务自己的“…”菜单里有它自己的删除选项，以及针对其运行记录的“全部标为已读”。每次删除前都会先询问，并说明哪些内容会被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the npm package %@ under %@" : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide delete clause: an npm global install; placeholders are the package and the prefix",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$@ 下的 npm 软件包 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The package could not be downloaded from %@." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: the codex package did not download; placeholder is its URL",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法从 %@ 下载发布包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The package did not carry the expected manifest and was discarded." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: the codex package's codex-package.json was missing or named another version",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发布包缺少预期的清单文件，已丢弃。"
