        }
      }
    },
    "The PDF could not be written." : {
      "comment" : "PDF export failure reason",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法写入 PDF 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The region entry must be a full URL starting with http:// or https://." : {
      "comment" : "Model setup: custom region text rejected at save time",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "地区输入必须是以 http:// 或 https:// 开头的完整 URL。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The robot chip under an agent session's message box chooses skills for that session. A ticked skill loads once, with your next message, and stays in the conversation; the chip turns orange while any skill is chosen, and clicking it shows where each one stands. When a long conversation is summarised, %@ and %@ are sent the skill again with your next message; %@ keeps it by itself, and is sent it again only when it had to trim your earlier messages to make room. Unticking a skill stops it from being sent again but can't take back what it already put into the conversation — to leave it behind, edit an earlier message or start a new session. %@ loads one skill per message, so its chip holds one skill at a time. The chip also lists the skills of the session folder's subfolders: %@ and %@ load them in any mode, and %@ only in a session started in that subfolder. Chat only loads no skills." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: how the skill chip loads skills; placeholders are the Claude Code, Codex and Kimi Code labels",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体会话输入框下方的机器人按钮用于为该会话选择技能。勾选的技能会随你的下一条消息加载一次，并保留在对话中；只要选了技能，按钮就会变成橙色，点击即可查看每个技能的状态。长对话被压缩后，%@ 和 %@ 会随你的下一条消息再次收到该技能，%@ 则会自行保留它，只有在它为腾出空间而裁剪了你之前的消息时，才会再次收到该技能。取消勾选只会让技能不再被发送，已经加载到对话中的内容无法撤回——如需摆脱它，请编辑更早的消息，或开启新会话。%@ 每条消息只加载一个技能，因此它的按钮一次只能选一个技能。按钮还会列出会话文件夹下各子文件夹的技能：%@ 和 %@ 在任何模式下都能加载，%@ 则只能在该子文件夹中启动的会话里加载。“仅对话”模式不加载任何技能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The run could not be started." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-run failure: the runner refused to start the turn",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
