    "What it does, and when to use it" : {
      "comment" : "Skills: description placeholder",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它做什么，何时使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you send to an AI model goes straight from your Mac to its provider, with your API key for a chat or through the provider's own tool for an agent session. It stays between you and that provider. Making a note sends that chat or session to your note model's provider. To learn how a provider handles your data, find its privacy policy online." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Privacy, second paragraph: what reaches an AI provider, and where its privacy policy is",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你发给 AI 模型的内容会直接从你的 Mac 发送给它的提供商：对话使用你的 API 密钥，智能体会话则通过提供商自己的工具。这些内容只在你和该提供商之间。生成笔记时，那段对话或会话会发送给生成笔记的模型的提供商。想了解某个提供商如何处理你的数据，请在网上查阅它的隐私政策。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's the difference between a chat and an agent session?" : {
      "comment" : "FAQ question",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对话和智能体会话有什么区别？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a newer version is found, SipAI updates the tool by itself, waiting for any running turn of that tool to finish first, and says so next to the logo in the sidebar." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane: what the automatic CLI update does",
      "localizations" : {
