    },
    "Yes, use reset" : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Usage: Codex's own answer that uses the limit reset; it cannot be undone",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "是，使用重置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes. While a turn runs, Send puts your message above the message box, where it waits. Steer, beside it, hands it to the running turn: the agent reads it at its next step — after the command it is running, say — and carries on with it in mind, and it appears in the conversation at that point. Left alone, it is sent as your next message the moment the turn ends. × puts it back in the message box, with any files it carries, so you can change it. After Stop nothing is sent by itself: Send, beside the message, sends it.\n\nSteer is offered with %@ version 2.1.310 or newer, and with %@ except in Chat only. A message that opens with a command, or loads a skill, waits for the turn's end, because an agent reads those only as a message of their own; so does one sent while the agent only waits for background work. %@ can't take a message during a turn, so its messages always wait." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: sending a message while a turn runs; placeholders, in order: the Claude Code, Codex and Kimi Code labels",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以。回合进行中时，点“发送”会把消息放在输入框上方，让它在那里等待。点它旁边的“插话”，会把它交给正在进行的这一回合：智能体会在下一步读到它——比如在正在运行的命令结束之后——并带着它继续工作，这条消息也会出现在对话中的那个位置。如果不去管它，这一回合一结束，它就会作为你的下一条消息发出。点 × 会把它连同所附的文件放回输入框，方便你修改。点“停止”之后，不会自动发送任何消息：点消息旁边的“发送”才会发出。\n\n使用 2.1.310 或更新版本的 %1$@ 时可以“插话”；%2$@ 除“仅对话”外也都可以。以命令开头或会加载技能的消息要等这一回合结束，因为智能体只会把它们当作单独的一条消息来读；智能体只在等待后台工作时发送的消息也是如此。%3$@ 无法在回合进行中接收消息，所以它的消息总是要等待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday" : {
      "comment" : "Date group",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "昨天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You" : {
      "comment" : "Default label shown above the user's own messages",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are a senior code reviewer. When the user shares code, analyze it for: bugs and logic errors, security vulnerabilities, performance issues, readability and style. Be specific — reference line numbers when possible. Suggest concrete fixes. If the code is good, say so briefly. If no code is shared, ask for it." : {
      "comment" : "System prompt of the built-in starter role shipped on a fresh install",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你是一位资深的代码审查员。当用户分享代码时，请从这些方面进行分析：缺陷与逻辑错误、安全漏洞、性能问题、可读性与代码风格。请给出具体意见——尽可能标注行号。给出可直接落地的修改建议。如果代码本身没有问题，简要说明即可。如果用户没有提供代码，请主动索取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can install a tool below or in Terminal. Either way, SipAI notices within a few seconds. Sign In opens the provider's own sign-in page. The tool keeps its own login, just as it does in Terminal." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide intro, second paragraph: installing and signing in",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以在下方安装工具，也可以在“终端”里安装。无论哪种方式，SipAI 都会在几秒内检测到。“登录”会打开提供商自己的登录页面。登录信息由工具自己保存，和在“终端”里一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You hit your spend cap set by the owner of your workspace. Ask an owner to increase your spend cap to continue." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Usage: Codex's own sentence when a workspace member hit the cap its owner set",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已达到工作区所有者设置的支出上限。请让所有者提高你的支出上限以继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You hit your spend cap set in your workspace. Increase your spend cap to continue." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Usage: Codex's own sentence when the workspace owner hit the spend cap",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已达到工作区设置的支出上限。请提高支出上限以继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're about to be taken to %@ to sign in. Finish there and come back to SipAI — the row updates by itself. The tool stores its own login on this Mac; SipAI never sees your password or a token." : {
      "comment" : "Agent Guide: body of the browser notice; placeholder is the website's host",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即将前往 %@ 登录。在那里完成后回到 SipAI 即可——这一行会自动更新。登录信息由工具保存在这台 Mac 上；SipAI 不会看到你的密码或令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
